  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">一款简单的模组，允许所有箭矢与“无限”附魔配合使用。</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">============ 演示 ============</span><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/N_B1uy8i8W8?wmode=transparent\" height=\"533\" width=\"533\"></iframe></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>======================================</strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Mod Loader-Forge-1E2D42\" alt=\"\" width=\"116\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Mod Loader-NeoForge-D7742F\" alt=\"\" width=\"138\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Mod Loader-Fabric-BCB29C\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&gameVersionTypeId=5\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Mod Loader-Quilt-DC29DD\" alt=\"\" width=\"110\" height=\"20\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-arrows-infinity-fix/files/6348984\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Version-1.12.2-ff5900\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"23\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:70886\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Version-1.16.x-ff5900\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"23\"></a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:73242\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Version-1.17.x-ff5900\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"23\"></a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:73250\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Version-1.18.x-ff5900\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"23\"></a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:73407\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Version-1.19.x-ff5900\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"23\"></a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:75125\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Version-1.20.x-ff5900\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"23\"></a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:77784\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Version-1.21.x-ff5900\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"23\"></a></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>功能</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">+</span> 所有箭矢，<strong>包括光靈箭和噴灑箭</strong>，都能與「無限」附魔配合使用</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">+</span> 也能與大多數模組新增的箭矢配合使用</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\">+</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果使用任何版本的 Forge/NeoForge，或 Fabric/Quilt 1.20.5 及以上版本，還將額外支持大多數模組新增的弓</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此模组的數據包版本可在此處獲取（如果您希望原版客戶端兼容）：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/all-arrows-infinity-fix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">All Arrows Infinity Fix [Data Pack]</a></p>\n<p>區別：模組版本使用 mixin 來檢查「無限」附魔並更改遊戲邏輯，而數據包版本則直接替換了「無限」附魔。如果您有其他修改「無限」附魔的數據包，則需要使用模組版本以維持兼容性。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>可配置、平衡性調整過的此模組版本：<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/most-arrows-infinity-fix\" rel=\"nofollow\">Most Arrows Infinity Fix</a></span>。</p>\n<p>喜歡這個模組嗎？您可能也會喜歡 Xtra Arrows（完全兼容 All Arrows Infinity Fix）：<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xtra-arrows\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xtra-arrows</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>與朋友一起玩這個模組！使用代碼 \"jackbusters\" 購買 Minecraft 服務器主機可享受 25% 折扣。</strong></span></pre>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fjackbusters%253fr%253dAll%2bArrows%2bInfinity%2bFix\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/ba99da02-fd57-4ccc-89a5-9a5bba0922d2.webp\" alt=\"Get 25% off Minecraft Server Hosting\" width=\"900\" height=\"150\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>整合包政策：</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;您可以自由地在 CurseForge 上託管的任何整合包中包含此模組。</p>",
